Gold dimension customers

Purpose : To identify the business organizations for the customers

customer_key: A surrogate key generated (often via ROW_NUMBER() or similar) to uniquely identify each customer in the Gold Layer 
customer_id: The business identifier from the source system (e.g., CRM)
customer_number: An alternative identifier (e.g., cst_key)
first_name / last_name: Customer names from CRM
country: Customer’s country from ERP or CRM
marital_status / gender: Demographic attributes, with gender derived from CRM first, falling back to ERP if needed
birthdate: Date of birth from ERP
create_date: When the customer record was created
